{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46957","headline":"自湘中将入蜀留别诸友 · 齐己","name":"自湘中将入蜀留别诸友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巾舃初随入蜀船，风帆吼过洞庭烟。\n七千里路到何处，十二峰云更那边。\n巫女暮归林淅沥，巴猨吟断月婵娟。\n来年五月峨嵋雪，坐看消融满锦川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}